to apply manual GIC for a period of time that has not previously had GIC




Manual GIC remission

	

to remit manual GIC postings.




Manual GIC adjustment

	

where GIC has been previously applied for a period of time, but requires a manual adjustment of the amount applied.




Manual GIC remission adjustment

	

to adjust a previously applied GIC remission (e.g. while correcting GIC remitted in error).

