Deferral to lodge AS and associated documents

Documents associated to activity statement (AS) include:

annual GST returns

annual GST information reports, and

annual PAYG withholding stationery.

If the deferral request is for multiple documents, each document may require different authorisation levels. Check if you have the authorisation for deferral on every document in the request. If no, the entire request must be escalated to the appropriate level. The escalation includes deferral of documents within your authorisation. This is to ensure consistency of decision making.

FTL penalty or other relevant penalty, if applicable, will begin to accrue from the date as varied.

The period of deferral:

is calculated from the later of the
statutory due date, when the document was due to be lodged which is the
original due date, or
concessional due date, or
deferred due date granted to a class or classes of taxpayers
